message: "If you use this work, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "Relational Rank Geometry in Transformers: Detecting and Steering Hidden-State Relation Frames"
authors:
  - family-names: "Kobrosly"
    given-names: "Mazen"
date-released: "2026-05-24"
version: "v1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mazenkobrosly-coder/relational-rank-geometry"
abstract: "This work introduces Plücker sign entropy as a rank-indexed diagnostic for relation-frame geometry in transformer hidden states, and tests whether relation-frame shape can be used as a behavioral intervention target in controlled edge-grid assays."
keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - transformer representations
  - relation frames
  - Plücker coordinates
  - activation steering
